<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:20:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>俄罗斯能否从内部改变</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/can-russia-ever-change-from-within-video</link><description>玛丽娜·利特维年科表示，弗拉基米尔·普京的体系注定会失败。她告诉米沙尔·侯赛因原因，并解释了接下来可能发生的事情。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/can-russia-ever-change-from-within-video'&gt;俄罗斯能否从内部改变&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Can Russia Ever Change From Within&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/can-russia-ever-change-from-within-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 14:54:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Rise at End of Wild Week in AI-Trade Bounce: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</link><description>美国股市有望反弹，纳斯达克 100 指数跌至熊市边缘后，风险偏好有所回升。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday'&gt;假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stocks Rebound as Traders Snap Up Battered Tech Shares&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:56:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>凯利说，人工智能可以为旅行者提供公平的竞争环境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-can-level-playing-field-for-travelers-kelly-says-video</link><description>“积分专家”布莱恩·凯利 (Brian Kelly) 表示，人工智能可以帮助为航空旅客创造公平的竞争环境，并表示尽可能快地使用这些航空里程。他在“彭博监视”节目中发表讲话。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-can-level-playing-field-for-travelers-kelly-says-video'&gt;凯利说，人工智能可以为旅行者提供公平的竞争环境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：AI Can Level Playing Field for Travelers, Kelly Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-can-level-playing-field-for-travelers-kelly-says-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:07:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</link><description>随着感恩节假期后市场重新开放，美国国债交投清淡，亚洲股市上涨抑制了对避险资产的需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens'&gt;股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Dip on Weaker Demand for Havens as Stocks Rebound&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:43:08 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>